{"seq":13,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T09:08:12.861Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"65d23a96c81b6e0f44575170d191329dea7801038ccfc75a205c4bf2470407b6","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Here's what I found for Marrow Fieldworks. I checked Moss's two Central digests and #central-random.\n\n1. #4409: from Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" digest (teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026). It's a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron during the 06:00 flatbed intake). Hollis flagged it as open before the 5 Jan handoff.\n2. #4412: same digest. It's a driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. Also flagged as open before the handoff.\n3. #8841: from your own message in #central-random on 13 Oct at 09:27. West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. Hollis had asked about \"Tobias's dealer account.\"\n\nA few caveats:\n- Neither source names Marrow Fieldworks next to these numbers. The digest lists them under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff but calls it \"Pree's dealer account.\" #8841 is tied to your dealer account. I'm treating the dealer account as Marrow Fieldworks, so check that against what you know.\n- #4409 and #4412 were open as of 2 Jan. I can't see their current status because there are no ticket files in the share I can read.\n- I left out FR-882 from the same digest. It's a feature request from Marrow Agrisupply, which is a different account (custom pallet-jack icons on the yard map).\n- Moss's Central cheat sheet only says \"door 4 msg\" under Marrow Agrisupply, with no ticket number.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124","thread_ts":"1791987000.000123"}}
